    brace_import_parse_errors_silent_2026-11-09, 0, "root cause: parser is correct (self-hosted and seed both reject; spec 5/5 green on unchanged src). The false pass came from the caller writing the fixture as a double-quoted literal, where {X} is string interpolation (see interp_brace_literal_collides_with_string_interpolation_2026-07-03), so the parser never saw a brace import. Fix: regression spec with raw-literal fixture; awaiting verification."

